==German==

===Etymology===
From {{term|Schmetten||cream|lang=de}} due to old belief that witches transformed themselves into butterflies to steal cream and other milk products.<!-- Duden - Deutsches Universalwörterbuch. 4. Aufl. Mannheim 2001.--> (Compare etymology of [[w:English language|English]] {{term|butterfly|lang=en}}.)

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈʃmɛtɐlɪŋ/|lang=de}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|m|Schmetterlings|gen2=Schmetterlinges|Schmetterlinge}}

# [[butterfly]] (insect)
# [[butterfly]] (swimming stroke)

